# rune's diagnostics on a terminal: the excerpt by default, where a pipe
# gets the first line only (docs/diagnostics.md). The screen is compared
# without its styles; tests/diagnostics checks those. The pane stays alive
# after rune ends, since tmux scrolls the screen to say that a pane died.
start 100 10 bin/rune tests/diagnostics/unbound.sml -o tests/out/terminal/unbound.rbc; sleep 30
wait \^\^\^\^\^\^
expect @DIR@/rune-diagnostics.screen
